# Cloudflare Workers static assets: response headers by request path (copied to dist/client by Vite).
# The app shell (index.html, served for every SPA route) must never be stored: WebKit (iPhone Safari)
# reuses a stored page on back/forward and tab restore without revalidating, which runs an old build
# against data a newer build wrote (an old home screen read the new identity format as "family undefined").
/*
  Cache-Control: no-store

# Hashed build files never change under the same name.
/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
